{"availability":"available","full":"Anil-matcha/seedance2-comfyui","name":"seedance2-comfyui","description":"Seedance 2.0, 2.5 & 2 Mini ComfyUI: custom nodes and workflows for ByteDance video generation via MuAPI — text-to-video, image-to-video, Omni Reference, consistent characters, and video extend.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":45,"forks":19,"created":"2023-11-16T10:34:16Z","updated":"2026-09-28T12:58:12Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://muapi.ai/playground/seedance-2.0-mini-image-to-video","topics":["ai","ai-video","ai-video-generation","bytedance","comfyui","comfyui-custom-nodes","comfyui-nodes","generative-ai","image-to-video","muapi","seedance","seedance-2-5","seedance-2-5-api","seedance-2-5-comfyui","seedance-2-mini","seedance2","text-to-video","video-ai","video-extend","video-generation"],"demo":"https://muapi.ai/playground/seedance-2.0-mini-image-to-video?utm_source=github&utm_medium=readme&utm_campaign=seedance2-comfyui","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T02:36:21.458Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T02:36:21.458Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T02:36:21.458Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T02:36:21.458Z","stars":45,"forks":19}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Looking for Seedance 2.5 ComfyUI custom nodes, Seedance 2.5 workflows, or a Seedance 2.5 API integration for ComfyUI? Use the dedicated Seedance 2.5 ComfyUI repository.","The companion pack supports the current Seedance 2.5 workflow surface: 720p and 480p text-to-video, image-to-video, first/last-frame transitions, Omni Reference with image/video/audio inputs, spicy generation, consistent characters, video saving, and Seedance-family extension. It is the recommended installation for native Seedance 2.5 generation; this repository remains the stable Seedance 2.0 and Seedance 2 Mini integration.","Seedance 2.0 is ByteDance's latest video generation model, capable of producing high-quality, photorealistic videos from text prompts or reference images. It supports:"],"features":["Text-to-Video — generate video from a text description","Image-to-Video — animate up to 9 reference images with motion guidance","Omni Reference — combine images, video clips, and audio as multi-modal reference inputs","Video Extend — seamlessly extend any generated video","Consistent Character — generate a 4K multi-panel character sheet from reference photos; use @character: inline in any prompt, or wire the sheet image directly into Consistent Character Video for tighter face fidelity"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Anil-matcha/seedance2-comfyui/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"38b50e4cd17b4ac4ea037de89456eb9af419f0b4ba1c914e1b40c0091df803cd","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T02:36:21.732Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T02:36:21.732Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Looking for Seedance 2.5 ComfyUI custom nodes, Seedance 2.5 workflows, or a Seedance 2.5 API integration for ComfyUI? Use the dedicated Seedance 2.5 ComfyUI repository.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Anil-matcha/seedance2-comfyui/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"Sign up at muapi.ai and go to Dashboard → API Keys → Create Key","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Anil-matcha/seedance2-comfyui/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"optional","text":"> Tip: If you use the MuAPI CLI, run muapi auth configure --api-key YOURKEY once and all nodes will pick it up automatically — no need to paste the key anywhere.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Anil-matcha/seedance2-comfyui/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"38b50e4cd17b4ac4ea037de89456eb9af419f0b4ba1c914e1b40c0091df803cd","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Anil-matcha/seedance2-comfyui/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T02:36:21.732Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-28T12:58:12Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Anil-